# LightFlux desktop and Expo Web run entirely locally and need no environment
# variables. Copying this file to `.env` changes nothing.
#
# The desktop build never reads a hosted API URL: `npm run desktop:web`,
# `npm run desktop:dev` and desktop bundles start with EXPO_NO_DOTENV=1 and
# talk only to the app's own loopback API (see scripts/export-desktop.mjs).
# The archived cloud code under `server/` and `deploy/` configures itself.
